{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01743","headline":"杂曲歌辞 东飞伯劳歌 · 李暇","name":"杂曲歌辞 东飞伯劳歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦王龙劒燕后琴，珊瑚宝匣镂双心。\n谁家女儿抱香枕，开衾灭烛愿侍寝。\n琼窗半上金缕帱，轻罗隐面不障羞。\n青绮帏中坐相忆，红罗镜里见愁色。\n檐花照月莺对栖，空将可怜暗中啼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李暇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}